2. SOURCE FACTS (code definitions)

   Error-code facts are re-derived from the public manufacturer support
   listings enumerated in SOURCES.md, with the exact source URL recorded per
   row. Underlying factual assignments (a code's meaning and implicated
   component) are facts and are not subject to copyright; no manufacturer
   manual text is reproduced verbatim. All meanings and repair steps in this
   dataset are original paraphrase.

